  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide Camp Coordination and Camp Management assistance to people affected by cyclone Mocha in Cox&apos;s Bazar District, and Chittagong Division. This UNHCR project provides humanitarian assistance to 175,000 people, including 46,129 women, 38,675 men, 90,196 children, and including 1,750 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
